1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,864
Look, a little paper heart!

2
00:00:03,114 --> 00:00:05,614
It's a thank-you heart.

3
00:00:06,164 --> 00:00:08,500
What are you thankful for?

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,319
Thankful means you feel happy for something you have.

5
00:00:16,169 --> 00:00:17,955
Here's our Thank-You Jar.

6
00:00:17,955 --> 00:00:18,848
Before bed,

7
00:00:18,848 --> 00:00:21,145
we put in three thank-you hearts.

8
00:00:21,695 --> 00:00:24,748
But I didn't get a present today.

9
00:00:24,998 --> 00:00:27,785
What can I say thank you for?

10
00:00:29,685 --> 00:00:32,656
I'll take a heart from the basket.

11
00:00:32,906 --> 00:00:34,422
Got one!

12
00:00:34,972 --> 00:00:37,315
Wait! Is that a heart?

13
00:00:39,315 --> 00:00:41,992
It's a sock with hearts on it!

14
00:00:42,242 --> 00:00:43,696
Pip's red sock!

15
00:00:43,696 --> 00:00:44,584
Hee hee!

16
00:00:45,134 --> 00:00:46,098
Silly me!

17
00:00:46,098 --> 00:00:48,024
That heart is a sock!

18
00:00:49,924 --> 00:00:53,817
This morning I played in the snow with my friends!

19
00:00:54,367 --> 00:00:57,461
Who is that puppy in the red hat?

20
00:00:57,711 --> 00:00:59,699
Say his name!

21
00:01:01,699 --> 00:01:03,307
It's me, Pip Puppy!

22
00:01:03,307 --> 00:01:04,257
Woof woof!

23
00:01:06,107 --> 00:01:08,955
How many friends played with me?

24
00:01:09,205 --> 00:01:11,172
Count with me!

25
00:01:12,972 --> 00:01:13,897
Pip, one.

26
00:01:13,897 --> 00:01:14,977
Dotty, two.

27
00:01:14,977 --> 00:01:16,210
Honey, three!

28
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:19,465
Can you wave to your friends?

29
00:01:19,715 --> 00:01:21,518
Wave, wave!

30
00:01:24,418 --> 00:01:25,978
My first thank-you!

31
00:01:25,978 --> 00:01:27,963
Thank you for my friends.

32
00:01:28,513 --> 00:01:30,993
What colour is this heart?

33
00:01:32,993 --> 00:01:34,794
Pink! In it goes.

34
00:01:34,794 --> 00:01:35,514
Plop!

35
00:01:38,414 --> 00:01:39,759
And at lunch,

36
00:01:39,759 --> 00:01:41,693
Mama made warm soup.

37
00:01:41,943 --> 00:01:42,885
Mmm!

38
00:01:43,435 --> 00:01:45,692
What colour is the soup?

39
00:01:47,692 --> 00:01:49,278
Orange carrot soup!

40
00:01:49,278 --> 00:01:50,719
Blow on it first,

41
00:01:50,719 --> 00:01:52,377
so it's not too hot.

42
00:01:52,627 --> 00:01:54,107
Whoo!

43
00:01:54,707 --> 00:01:57,474
Yum! Can you pat your tummy?

44
00:01:57,724 --> 00:01:59,732
Pat, pat, pat!

45
00:02:02,632 --> 00:02:04,378
My second thank-you!

46
00:02:04,378 --> 00:02:06,730
Thank you for my yummy food.

47
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,761
What colour is this heart?

48
00:02:11,761 --> 00:02:14,466
Yellow, like the sunshine!

49
00:02:14,716 --> 00:02:15,761
Plop!

50
00:02:17,611 --> 00:02:18,758
Now one more.

51
00:02:18,758 --> 00:02:21,197
Hmm, what's my third thank-you?

52
00:02:21,797 --> 00:02:23,658
Look around you, Lulu.

53
00:02:23,658 --> 00:02:25,073
What do you see?

54
00:02:26,673 --> 00:02:28,207
A warm house.

55
00:02:28,207 --> 00:02:29,931
A soft blanket.

56
00:02:30,181 --> 00:02:32,927
And a big snuggly hug!

57
00:02:34,777 --> 00:02:37,667
Thank you for my cosy home!

58
00:02:38,217 --> 00:02:40,697
What colour is this heart?

59
00:02:42,697 --> 00:02:44,459
Blue! Plop!

60
00:02:45,009 --> 00:02:47,631
Can you give yourself a big hug?

61
00:02:47,881 --> 00:02:49,580
Squeeze!

62
00:02:53,780 --> 00:02:56,328
Let's count the hearts together.

63
00:02:56,728 --> 00:02:58,621
How many hearts?

64
00:03:00,421 --> 00:03:01,881
One, two, three!

65
00:03:01,881 --> 00:03:03,802
Pink, yellow and blue!

66
00:03:05,652 --> 00:03:08,526
Wait! I have a surprise heart, too.

67
00:03:09,076 --> 00:03:10,306
A surprise?

68
00:03:10,306 --> 00:03:12,150
What colour is it?

69
00:03:14,150 --> 00:03:16,021
Purple! Thank you, Lulu,

70
00:03:16,021 --> 00:03:17,615
for being my friend!

71
00:03:18,165 --> 00:03:19,135
Oh, Honey!

72
00:03:19,135 --> 00:03:22,345
That makes my heart feel warm and glowy!

73
00:03:25,595 --> 00:03:27,598
Look! The jar is glowing,

74
00:03:27,598 --> 00:03:29,529
and here comes the Moon!

75
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:32,163
When you say thank you,

76
00:03:32,163 --> 00:03:34,246
two friends feel happy.

77
00:03:34,496 --> 00:03:37,266
Your friend, and you!

78
00:03:37,816 --> 00:03:41,033
Who can you say thank you to tonight?

79
00:03:44,333 --> 00:03:45,507
Into bed now.

80
00:03:45,507 --> 00:03:47,561
Let's do heart breathing!

81
00:03:48,111 --> 00:03:50,693
Put your hand on your heart.

82
00:03:51,243 --> 00:03:52,893
Breathe in slowly,

83
00:03:52,893 --> 00:03:55,014
like smelling warm soup.

84
00:03:57,414 --> 00:03:59,099
Breathe out slowly,

85
00:03:59,099 --> 00:04:00,631
and blow it cool.

86
00:04:00,881 --> 00:04:02,008
Whoo.

87
00:04:04,408 --> 00:04:06,654
Now stretch your arms up high,

88
00:04:06,654 --> 00:04:09,172
and wrap them round in a cosy hug.

89
00:04:12,272 --> 00:04:13,583
Sing with me,

90
00:04:13,583 --> 00:04:15,386
and do the actions!

91
00:04:15,986 --> 00:04:18,018
Thank you for my friends,

92
00:04:18,018 --> 00:04:19,470
who play with me.

93
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:21,523
Wave, wave!

94
00:04:21,923 --> 00:04:25,038
Thank you for my food, so yummy.

95
00:04:25,288 --> 00:04:27,255
Pat your tummy!

96
00:04:27,655 --> 00:04:29,519
Thank you for my home,

97
00:04:29,519 --> 00:04:31,159
so warm and bright.

98
00:04:31,409 --> 00:04:33,643
Hug yourself tight!

99
00:04:34,043 --> 00:04:37,096
Thank you, thank you, and goodnight!

100
00:04:37,346 --> 00:04:39,334
Blow a kiss!

101
00:04:41,434 --> 00:04:43,643
One more time, softly.

102
00:04:43,643 --> 00:04:44,262
Shh.

103
00:04:44,862 --> 00:04:46,725
Thank you for my home,

104
00:04:46,725 --> 00:04:48,366
so warm and bright.

105
00:04:48,616 --> 00:04:50,849
Hug yourself tight!

106
00:04:51,249 --> 00:04:54,302
Thank you, thank you, and goodnight!

107
00:04:54,552 --> 00:04:56,540
Blow a kiss!

108
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:59,348
Yawn. Thank you, Honey.

109
00:04:59,348 --> 00:05:00,352
Goodnight.

110
00:05:02,652 --> 00:05:05,548
Blow a kiss to someone you love,

111
00:05:05,548 --> 00:05:07,285
and say thank you.

112
00:05:07,535 --> 00:05:09,079
Goodnight!

113
00:05:10,679 --> 00:05:14,547
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

114
00:05:15,147 --> 00:05:16,094
Next time,

115
00:05:16,094 --> 00:05:18,425
Pip Puppy makes a snow bunny.

116
00:05:18,675 --> 00:05:19,904
But drip, drip,

117
00:05:19,904 --> 00:05:21,269
where will it go?

118
00:05:21,869 --> 00:05:23,791
Sweet dreams, friends!

119
00:05:23,791 --> 00:05:26,943
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!
